   "created": 1790968047,
   "description": "Objective likeness check: detect the faces in a candidate image and score them against the people in reference photos (ArcFace cosine similarity, buffalo_l and antelopev2 averaged, one-to-one matching, margin against the other people). Returns per-person score, verdict (match, uncertain, mismatch, missing), reliability and the thresholds used. Runs on CPU in the face sidecar, about 2 seconds. Infant faces are flagged reliability=low and never reach \"match\": ArcFace-class recognisers are weak on infants. Calibration data and thresholds are in docs/IDENTITY_LIKENESS.md.",
   "id": "face-likeness",
